{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 49, :comments ["<b>תדמה</b> — like the sense of לא תדמה לכל עינו (it shall not cease before his eyes), and this is far-fetched:" "The heh of <b>הפוגות</b> is like the tav of תרומות:"], :book :lamentations, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "The verse Ibn Ezra alludes to (Lam 3:49 reads תדמה עיני; the form לא תדמה לכל עינו does not occur verbatim in any biblical verse; possibly a paraphrastic reference to Lam 3:49 itself or a citation now obscured."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Lamentations -- Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%9E%D7%92%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9B%D7%94"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:53.406775982Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}